define user ask off topic
  "write a python script for snake game"
  "who won the cricket world cup"
  "tell me a recipe for biryani"
  "what is the capital of France"
  "write me a song about space"
  "how to build a website in react"

define flow check off topic
  user ask off topic
  bot respond off topic
  stop

define bot respond off topic
  "I am NyayaVaani, your Indian civic and legal grievance assistant. I can only assist with civic complaints, local municipal procedures, legal rights, and Indian acts."
